pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: top-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: dir-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 10, 80, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        Ch06
  - elementId: ev-badge-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: ev-badge-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1060, 10, 160, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        E0 / Spec
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 36, 990, 42]
    content:
      fontSize: 32
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>RATS 架构 — 内容摘要</strong></p>
  - elementId: title-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 80, 120, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 92, 1160, 590]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>定义 attester、verifier、relying party、evidence、endorsements、reference values、attestation results 和 appraisal policy。</p>
        <p>RFC 9334 定义了当前跨 TEE 远程 attestation 的 RATS 架构。规范化 evidence 生成、传递、评估角色与拓扑。是跨平台 attestation 术语和 verifier policy 的权威基线，但不证明任一平台测量链充分。</p>
        <p>论文定位：代表性改进；材料类型：规范/标准材料；证据等级：E0 / Spec-standard SOTA。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 1160, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        来源：RATS 架构｜证据等级：E0 / Spec-standard SOTA
  - elementId: bottom-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 714, 1280, 6]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
